esources Center (1 items) Student Transitions (1 items) Undergraduate Enrollment Programs (2 items) Work Type Search employment types 3 filter options found Work Type Full Time (45 items) Part Time (8 items) Seasonal or Temporary (9 items) Locations Search cities 3 filter options found Locations Hybrid: in-office and remote work (5 items) Remote (US Only) (1 items) Troy, NY (47 items) Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me Assistant Coach, Women's Hockey Troy, NY Athletics Athletics Staff Full Time The duties and responsibilities of the Assistant Coach for Women’s Ice Hockey are to assist the Head Coach in the management and administration of a Division I Women’s Hockey program. The core responsibilities of the Assistant Coach are to recommend, implement and execute a successful recruiting philosophy and strategy to ensure student-athletes are committed and engaged academically, athletically, and socially. In addition, the Assistant Coach is responsible for preparing student-athletes both on and off the ice with instruction of an academic and personal nature. The Assistant Coach will also serve as coordinator for position-specific players and will assist in the development of all position players. Read more Assistant Coach, Women's Lacrosse Troy, NY ICA Sports Athletics Staff Full Time Closing on: Sep 17 2026 The Assistant Coach, Women's Lacrosse provides coaching, recruiting, and administrative support to the Head Coach in all aspects of the Women's Lacrosse program. This position assists with planning and conducting practices and competitions, instructing and mentoring student-athletes, identifying and recruiting qualified prospective student-athletes, supporting academic success, and promoting student-athlete development on and off the field. The Assistant Coach also assists with program operations, fundraising, alumni engagement, team travel, NCAA and conference compliance, and other administrative responsibilities that contribute to the success and competitiveness of the Women's Lacrosse program. Read more Assistant Director, Undergraduate Admissions Troy, NY Enrollment Planning CFHE Staff Student Services and Academic Support Full Time Join the Office of Undergraduate Admissions at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI) as an Admissions Counselor or Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions and help recruit and enroll the next generation of innovative STEM students. These opportunities offer the chance to build relationships with prospective students, families, and school counselors while supporting recruitment, application review, and enrollment initiatives, with position level determined by your experience and qualifications. If you're passionate about higher education, enjoy travel, and thrive in a relationship-focused environment, we'd love to hear from you. Read more Director, Recruitment & Partnerships Troy, NY Lally School of M & T Dean's Office Business, Accounting and Finance CFHE Staff Student Services and Academic Support Show More Show Less Full Time The Director of Recruitment and Partnerships leads strategic recruitment, outreach, and enrollment initiatives for the Lally School of Management. This position develops partnerships, implements recruitment strategies, and collaborates with campus stakeholders to support enrollment goals. Read more Deputy Title IX Coordinator / Equal Opportunity Specialist Hybrid: in-office and remote work Troy, NY Human Resources Office CFHE Human Resources Staff Full Time The Deputy Title IX Coordinator / Equal Opportunity Specialist supports the Institute’s commitment to an equitable, inclusive, and discrimination-free living, learning, and working environment. The position provides dedicated support for the effective administration of the Institute’s Title IX, Equal Opportunity, Title VI, and related civil rights compliance programs, helping ensure fair, thorough, and supportive processes for all participants. Read more Space Planning Coordinator Hybrid: in-office and remote work Troy, NY Campus Planning & Facilities Design CFHE Staff Student Services and Academic Support Full Time Coordinates campus space planning, occupancy, and departmental moves while partnering with academic and administrative stakeholders to develop practical space solutions. Supports space data management, CAD-based planning, project coordination, and successful workplace transitions across the Institute. Read more Planner, Research and Lab Facilities Troy, NY Campus Planning & Facilities Design Business, Accounting and Finance Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time Lead campus space planning initiatives that support RPI's research, laboratory, and academic mission. This position partners with faculty and campus stakeholders to program, analyze, and optimize research space, ensuring efficient utilization while supporting strategic planning, capital projects, and long-range campus development. Read more Assistant Director, Transfer Admissions Hybrid: in-office and remote work Troy, NY Undergraduate Enrollment Programs CFHE Staff Student Services and Academic Support Full Time The Assistant Director of Transfer Admissions provides hands-on leadership of strategic community college recruitment efforts, operationalization of Memoranda of Understanding (MOUs), and credit evaluation support. This position focuses on building and maintaining community college partnerships for transfer student recruitment. This position requires the ability to travel domestically and internationally. Regular weekend and evening availability is required during fall recruitment and spring yield seasons. Read more Roofer, Sr. Troy, NY Physical Plant Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time RPI is seeking a Roofing and Plumbing Maintenance Technician to support the installation, repair, and preventative maintenance of campus roofing and gutter systems. This hands-on role focuses on maintaining a variety of roofing systems while assisting with minor plumbing and general facilities maintenance across campus. The ideal candidate is a skilled trades professional with roofing experience who enjoys working in a team-oriented environment and contributing to a safe, well-maintained campus. Read more Operating Mechanic Troy, NY Physical Plant Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute is seeking Operating Mechanic candidates to support the safe, reliable operation and maintenance of its central and satellite steam plants. These positions perform boiler and auxiliary equipment operations, preventive and emergency maintenance, water and chemical treatment, troubleshooting, and related facility support across campus. Read more HVAC/r Technician Troy, NY Physical Plant Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time The HVAC/r Technician will perform diversified duties for maintenance, repair and installation of refrigeration, air conditioning, chilled water, compressed air, heating and ventilation systems and associated controls. Participates in on-call rotation in accordance with standard operating procedures. Read more Public Safety Communications Specialist Troy, NY Public Safety Office Public Safety Staff Full Time The Public Safety Communications Specialist is responsible for monitoring, responding, and taking appropriate actions for incoming calls for service; process emergency and non-emergency communications, multi-agency radio communications, and provide documentation for these incidents in support of Public Safety operations. This position also serves as the focal point for all Institute communications outside normal business hours Read more Assistant Vice Provost, Undergraduate Admissions Troy, NY Enrollment Management Office Business, Accounting and Finance CFHE Staff Student Services and Academic Support Show More Show Less Full Time The Assistant Vice Provost for Undergraduate Admissions would lead the full\nundergraduate admissions operation, roughly thirty positions together with the\nrecruitment and visit budgets, and would carry a central share of responsibility for net\ntuition revenue. The Assistant Vice Provost level gives the position the standing it needs\nto work as a peer with the academic deans, the marketing office, and the financial aid\noffice, and it matches the practice at peer science and technology institutions. Read more Associate Director, Design & Construction Troy, NY Campus Planning & Facilities Design Business, Accounting and Finance CFHE Staff Full Time The Associate Director of Design & Construction leads the planning, design, and delivery of capital, renovation, deferred maintenance, and infrastructure projects across Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute's campus. Reporting to the Director of Campus Planning & Facilities Design, this role oversees projects from concept through completion, ensuring they are delivered safely, on time, within budget, and in compliance with institutional priorities and regulatory requirements. The position manages internal project staff and external consultants and contractors while partnering with campus stakeholders to deliver projects that support RPI's academic, research, and strategic goals. Read more Captain Troy, NY Public Safety Office Public Safety Staff Full Time Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute seeks a Special Service & Community Engagement Captain to play a pivotal role in advancing campus safety, preparedness, and community engagement. This leadership position oversees recruitment and onboarding of Public Safety staff, manages training and compliance programs, and develops technical and operational solutions to strengthen security systems. The Captain also coordinates large-scale emergency drills, facilitates law enforcement partnerships, and leads outreach programs with students, faculty, and staff to build trust and foster a safe, inclusive campus community. Read more Fleet Mechanic Troy, NY Environmental & Site Services Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute seeks a Fleet Mechanic to perform maintenance, diagnostics, and repairs on campus vehicles and equipment, including emergency and snow removal support, within a collaborative and service-focused environment. Read more Assistant Coach, Track & Field Troy, NY ICA Sports Athletics Staff Full Time Seasonal or Temporary Assistant Coach, Track & Field provides coaching and administrative assistance to the Head Coach. Oversee one or more specified areas of a sporting discipline or a component of a team, and assist the Head Coach with all aspects of recruitment and training of athletes. Read more Sergeant Troy, NY Public Safety Office Public Safety Staff Full Time The Public Safety Sergeant provides front-line supervision of Public Safety Officers and oversees daily shift operations to ensure the safety and security of the Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute community. This position is responsible for staff supervision, emergency response coordination, investigations, report review, conflict resolution, and law enforcement collaboration. The Sergeant serves as a leader and role model while maintaining a safe campus environment through effective decision-making, communication, and personnel management. Read more Repairer Troy, NY Physical Plant Staff Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time The Repairer performs basic repair and maintenance assignments on facilities and equipment using a variety of trades such as, but not limited to, carpentry, mechanical, electrical, plumbing, painting, and masonry. Also works as a part of a team to complete larger scale renovations. This position participates in on-call rotation for off-hour repairs in academic and residential buildings. Read more Administrative Operations Manager(s) :  Lally School of Management and the School of Humanities, Arts, and Social Sciences Troy, NY Lally School of M & T Dean's Office Administrative Support Business, Accounting and Finance CFHE Lally School of Management School of Humanities, Arts, and Social Sciences Staff Show More Show Less Full Time Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute is seeking two experienced Administrative Operations  Managers to provide strategic administrative and operational leadership within the Lally School of Management and the School of Humanities, Arts, and Social Sciences (HASS). These positions serve as key partners to the Deans, overseeing school-wide administrative operations, faculty affairs, executive support, strategic initiatives, and operational priorities that advance each School’s mission and goals. Read more Materials & Manufacturing Researchers Troy, NY Research: Materials & Manufacturing Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century.\n\nThe cross-disciplinary research leverages a convergence of expertise in materials, advanced manufacturing, and control systems, emphasizing synergistic integration of these fields to derive system-level solutions to complex technological challenges. The faculty's research interests encompass a broad spectrum of areas, including but not limited to energy materials, nanomaterials, nanocomposites, nanoscale heat transfer, thermoelectrics, nanomechanics, fiber-reinforced composites, additive manufacturing, nonlinear control systems, micromachining, spaceflight dynamics and control, tribology, nonlinear dynamics, nuclear materials, biomaterials, smart and adaptive materials, as well as computational approaches in nanomechanics and biomechanics. Read more Life Sciences & Biotechnology Researchers Troy, NY Research: Life Sciences & Biotechnology Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century.\n\nRensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI) is a leader in the field of life sciences and biotechnology, offering a dynamic environment for research and innovation. The Shirley Ann Jackson, Ph.D. Center for Biotechnology and Interdisciplinary Studies (CBIS) is a key component, focusing on fundamental and translational research to address global health challenges. RPI's Biological Sciences department provides a comprehensive curriculum that prepares students for various career paths in research, medicine, and industry. The institute's commitment to interdisciplinary research and innovative education positions it as a significant player in the biotechnology sector. Read more Future of Computation Researchers Troy, NY Research: Future of Computation Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century. The Future Computation research cluster includes Rensselaer’s Future of Computing Institute (FOCI). Computational research at RPI will lead research in exploiting the emerging future of computation. The institute will explore the strains the global problems facing humanity place on the computational models of today. Read more Microelectronics Researchers Troy, NY Research: Microelectronics Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century.\n\nMicroelectronics has played a significant role in nearly every major technological development of the last half-century. In keeping with our creative, interdisciplinary reputation for innovation, Rensselaer researchers cover the whole semiconductor spectrum, from theory to practice to product and from bench to bedside, across materials, design, devices, and systems. Please visit chips.rpi.edu for more information. Read more Fundamental Knowledge Researchers Troy, NY Research: Fundamental Knowledge Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century.\n\nRPI is a leading technological research university with a diverse range of research centers and programs focused on addressing global challenges through innovative research.  Primarily clustered around five broad areas (Materials and Microelectronics; Future of Computation; Life Sciences and Biotechnology; Microelectronics; and Energy, Environment, and Sustainability), the institute has opportunities in other fundamental knowledge disciplines. Read more Energy, Environment, and Sustainability Researchers Troy, NY Research: Energy, Environment, and Sustainability Researchers and Research Support Full Time Part Time Seasonal or Temporary Over the past decade, the research portfolio at Rensselaer has been completely transformed. As a top-tier technological research university, Rensselaer has invested in strategic partnerships, talented researchers, and sophisticated research platforms to address the most pressing global challenges of the 21st century. \n\nRPI partners with industry, government, and academic institutions to accelerate renewable energy research, move technologies from the laboratory to the marketplace, and, ultimately, build and sustain economic value. Read more Administrative Coordinator Troy, NY Sch of Humn & Social Sci Office Administrative Support Staff Full Time The Administrative Coordinator supports the strategic and operational effectiveness of HASS by coordinating department-level operations, academic and research-related activities, events, scheduling, procurement, compliance, and administrative processes. The position works closely with the Manager of Administrative Operations, Department Heads, search committees, and other stakeholders to ensure efficient and consistent departmental operations. Read more Director, Sport Performance and Wellness Troy, NY Athletics Athletics Business, Accounting and Finance Staff Full Time The Director, Sport Performance & Wellness will lead and manage RPI Athletics’ Sport Performance & Wellness initiatives, providing strategic oversight of data collection, integration, and performance programming to enhance student-athlete safety, development, and wellbeing. The Director will oversee Strength & Conditioning operations, collaborate with coaches and Athletic Training staff, and design and implement training programs supporting Division I hockey student-athletes. Read more Computer Operator Troy, NY Networking and Telecommunications CFHE Information Technology Staff Full Time (1st and 2nd shift - see details) The Computer Operator performs standard operational procedures and provides support services for internal and external users of the computers and peripheral equipment. The Computer Operator is responsible for the accurate and timely processing of information and services in a multi-disciplined computing environment, including initiating and monitoring application programs and systems utilities, and quality control. Read more Laboratory Supervisor Troy, NY Civil Engineering CFHE Student Services and Academic Support Trades, Service, and Maintenance Full Time The Instructional Laboratory Supervisor oversees the daily operations of engineering instructional laboratories, ensuring a safe, efficient, and effective learning environment for faculty, staff, and students. This position provides technical expertise, maintains laboratory equipment and facilities, supports instructional activities, and promotes compliance with safety and accreditation standards. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 47 in total ‹ 1 2 › Powered by PageUp Sign up for job alerts Job Alert 360a9910 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employment Type Locations First Name (required) 0697cc73 Last Name (required) 4f34c2e5 Email (required) 43b16fb6 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you © 2026 Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI) Cookie Preferences Web Privacy TileX Student Consumer Information Accessibilityy Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all Please choose the location(s)"
